  "description": "ASP.NET Core host for the Delibera multi-model AI council framework: debate, scenario, corpus, SSE streaming and MCP endpoints mountable inside an existing application through AddDeliberaServer/UseDeliberaServer. All routes live under /api/v1 so they cannot collide with your own endpoints. Depends on Delibera.Core.",
